00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:04.580
How could I pass him anything? They frisked me in the warden's office.

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:09.330
Listen, Nick, I'm doing everything I can to keep him from sending you back to federal prison.

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:11.450
I've been in touch with a lot of big-shot politicians.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:15.060
Don't bother with the politicians. I told you to get in touch with the governor.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:18.000
He's been away. I'm going to talk to him by long distance.

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:18.720
