00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:28.790
A couple, huh?

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.640
Don't worry, Nick. I'll do the best I can.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.720
Anyway, they won't take you away from here till you're feeling better.

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:36.330
As though they'd consider my feelings.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:37.510
Sorry, lady. Time's up.

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.490
Oh, but I've hardly spoken to him.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.310
That's your hard luck. Come on. Time's up.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.850
Okay. Thanks for the lady's stuff, anyway.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:44.570
You're a gent.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:47.260
Goodbye, Nick. I'll let you know how things go.

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:49.690
Just keep in mind, I'm working for you every minute.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:51.640
Okay, kid. You're swell.

